DTSTAMP:20261104T162449Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Deadline: First Flights Short Film Fund (Autumn 2026 Round)
DESCRIPTION:First Flights funds emerging filmmakers worldwide making live a
 ction and documentary shorts in any scripted genre (scripts up to 30 pages
 ). The autumn 2026 round awards up to GBP 7\,000 / USD 10\,000 in cash tow
 ard production costs\, plus two Kodak awards of five 400ft rolls of 16mm f
 ilm stock with complete processing\, and one USD 10\,000 post-production p
 ackage from Periscope.\n\nOrganisation: First Flights Media Limited\, with
  Kodak and Periscope\nLocation: UK-based fund\, open to filmmakers worldwi
 de\nAward: Up to GBP 7\,000 / USD 10\,000 cash toward production\; plus tw
 o Kodak awards of 5 x 400ft rolls of 16mm stock with full processing\, and
  one USD 10\,000 Periscope post-production package\nDuration: Production m
 ust begin within six months of the application deadline\n\nMore: https://w
 ww.first-flights.com/short-film-fund/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdes
 k&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.first-flights.com/short-film-fund/?utm_source=artificialnou
 veaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:UK-based fund\, open to filmmakers worldwide
END:VEVENT
