 reat Ars Award for Best Film: SEK 4\,000 plus a physical trophy\; Best Fea
 ture Film and Best Short Film: SEK 2\,000 plus an official diploma each. A
 ll cash prizes are split equally between director and producer and paid wi
 thin six months after the festival. Submission fees apply: USD 5 to 18 dep
 ending on category and deadline tier.\nDuration: Festival runs 16 to 18 Ju
 ly 2027\n\nMore: https://filmmakers.festhome.com/festival/9290?utm_source=
