 nt 2027 (EUR 90\,000 to 510\,000 per slate\, incl. immersive)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 01 Dec 2026 at 17:00 CET.\n\nThe MEDIA Slate Development
  call (CREA-MEDIA-2027-DEVSLATE) funds established European independent pr
 oduction companies to develop a slate of audiovisual works with cross-bord
 er potential: fiction\, animation\, creative documentary and immersive pro
 jects.\n\nOrganisation: Creative Europe MEDIA (European Commission / EACEA
 )\nLocation: EU Member States\, EEA and countries associated to Creative E
 urope MEDIA. For organisations (legal entities) established in a MEDIA cou
 ntry\; natural persons cannot apply. Single established independent produc
 tion company.\nAward: EUR 90\,000 to EUR 510\,000 per slate\, built from f
 ixed lump sums per project type (for example EUR 30\,000 for a one-off cre
 ative documentary\, EUR 60\,000 for an animated series\, EUR 75\,000 for a
  fiction series budgeted EUR 5-20 million). Total call budget EUR 22\,374\
 ,320. No application fee.\nDuration: Projects normally up to 36 months. Ca
 ll opened 30 September 2026.\n\nMore: https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-te
 nders/opportunities/portal/screen/opportunities/topic-details/CREA-MEDIA-2
 027-DEVSLATE?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportunities/portal/screen/o
 pportunities/topic-details/CREA-MEDIA-2027-DEVSLATE?utm_source=artificialn
 ouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:EU Member States\, EEA and countries associated to Creative Europe
  MEDIA. For organisations (legal entities) established in a MEDIA country\
 ; natural persons cannot apply. Single established independent production 
 company.
END:VEVENT
